    "date": "2026-09-21",
    "html": "<p>Hello BBC&nbsp;Choir!</p><p>Below are a few reminders from last week's CHOIR NEWS email.</p><p>The next CHOIR NEWS email will be sent out the week of&nbsp;Oct. 12.</p><p></p><p><u><b>DENDLERS OUT-OF TOWN</b></u></p><p></p><p>Beth and I will be out-of-town&nbsp;Sept. 27&nbsp;and&nbsp;Oct. 1-10.</p><p></p><p></p><p><b><u>EVENING CHOIR PRACTICES&nbsp;</u></b></p><p>Sept. 27&nbsp;-&nbsp; in the chapel</p><p>Oct. 4 - in the auditorium</p><p>Thank you for your faithfulness!<br></p>",
